sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as iPhone Client
    participant A as FastAPI
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant W as Background Worker
    participant R as Reference Corpus
    C->>A: Submit crop and submission key
    A->>A: Validate and store temporary input
    A->>D: Create request and pending job
    D-->>A: Transaction committed
    A-->>C: 202 Accepted with identifiers
    Note over C,W: Background work continues independently of the client
    W->>D: Atomically claim pending job
    D-->>W: Job and input reference
    W->>W: Run pretrained feature extraction
    W->>R: Read frame features and GIF references
    R-->>W: Stored features and asset references
    W->>W: Compare features and rank GIF candidates
    W->>W: Validate GIFs and prepare temporary media
    alt Retrieval succeeds
        W->>D: Commit candidates or no-match and completed state
    else Processing fails
        W->>D: Record typed error and failed state
    end
    loop While result screen is open
        C->>A: Query request status
        A->>D: Read job state and candidates
        D-->>A: Current state and availability
        A-->>C: Status and results
    end
    alt User accepts a candidate
        C->>A: Submit acceptance and review key
        A->>D: Persist review decision
        A-->>C: Review recorded
        C->>A: Download selected animation
        A-->>C: Validated GIF from task cache
        C->>C: Save locally and verify playback
    else User rejects all candidates
        C->>A: Submit reject-all decision
        A->>D: Persist rejection
        A-->>C: Review recorded
    else No match or execution failure
        C->>C: Show outcome and explicit next action
    end
